1
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:11,140
Turn on the lights and take a step back,
will you?

2
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:24,320
Anyone short on cash, come see me.

3
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:29,000
Not that I have any either, so don't worry.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,800
Look at that blue sky.

5
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:36,320
White clouds.

6
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:42,700
Something will work out eventually, right?

7
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:45,980
You get it, right?

8
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:47,980
Got it, got it.

9
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:51,920
Once you understand, shut up and follow me.

10
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:06,480
Mm.

11
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:06,860
Mm.

12
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:24,980
Aaaaaaah!

13
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:26,260
Aaaaaaah!

14
00:01:26,260 --> 00:01:27,260
Aaaaaaah!

15
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:28,360
Shut up already!

16
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:29,900
Aaaaaaah!

17
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:32,720
Honestly, I'm not even sleepy, you know.

18
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:34,020
Who's there?

19
00:01:40,420 --> 00:01:41,840
What is this?

20
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,740
Who's it from?

21
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:51,060
There's nothing written on it, though.

22
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:52,720
It's addressed to me, right?

23
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,820
A camera?

24
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,120
What's this?

25
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:04,180
This camera is a cursed camera.

26
00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:05,780
Within one week,

27
00:02:05,780 --> 00:02:07,680
take photos of policewomen in swimsuits.

28
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,820
If you don't take 100 of them,

29
00:02:08,820 --> 00:02:10,680
you will be cursed with misfortune.

30
00:02:11,220 --> 00:02:14,820
Also, taking any other photos
will bring misfortune too,

31
00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:16,900
so please be very careful.

32
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:18,180
What is this?

33
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:20,780
What nonsense.

34
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:22,920
A cursed camera, my foot!

35
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,140
What a ridiculous story.

36
00:02:24,140 --> 00:02:25,660
Who would believe that?

37
00:02:31,220 --> 00:02:32,940
Why is there a washbasin...

38
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,400
No way...

39
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,800
What a stupid story!

40
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,980
Where did this come falling from?

41
00:02:55,780 --> 00:03:00,400
Could this really be a cursed camera?

42
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,860
Why would something
like this end up with me?

43
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:07,860
I don't want this thing.

44
00:03:09,780 --> 00:03:11,160
Well, that's a relief.

45
00:03:15,140 --> 00:03:18,300
It's a curse! This camera is really cursed!

46
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,480
This camera is a cursed camera.

47
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:28,400
Swimsuit photos of
policewomen within one week.

48
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:34,480
Come to think of it, we're supposed to go
to the sea on the Katsushika City trip soon.

49
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,740
Well, that's easy, isn't it?

50
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:45,780
Just you wait, cursed camera-chan,
I'll get a hundred or two hundred photos.

51
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:50,340
Just as you wish,
I'll snap and snap and snap away!

52
00:03:52,180 --> 00:03:54,660
Get the swimsuit photos!

53
00:03:57,160 --> 00:04:00,840
W-what?
This year's trip is to the mountains?

54
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,560
Senpai, you didn't know?

55
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:08,040
I didn't know! The trip has always been decided as the sea every year,
hasn't it?

56
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:10,820
The disrespectful folks went
and decided it on their own.

57
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,520
Without even asking us men.

58
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:16,060
What a joke!

59
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:23,000
Why did you two change
the trip to the mountains?

60
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,480
What, you caveman?

61
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:26,340
Got a problem with that or something?

62
00:04:26,340 --> 00:04:28,620
Summer means the beach, damn it!

63
00:04:28,620 --> 00:04:31,320
This year,
a resort lodge opened up in the mountains.

64
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:34,100
So this year, we're going to the mountains.

65
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:34,660
Hey,

66
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:38,020
the sea is a major enemy to your skin.

67
00:04:38,020 --> 00:04:39,420
It's full of UV rays, you know.

68
00:04:39,420 --> 00:04:42,800
Right, to prevent sunburn,
the mountains are definitely better.

69
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:43,720
Right?

70
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:48,060
Summer mountains are quiet,
and they're cool too.

71
00:04:48,060 --> 00:04:49,880
They're healing, too.

72
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,120
Right?

73
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,700
Not "right," right?

74
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:54,900
Well, I'll never accept that!

75
00:04:54,900 --> 00:04:56,680
It has to be the sea, the sea!

76
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:59,120
What are you saying, you rotten caveman?

77
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,480
It's already been decided.

78
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,640
We can't change it now.

79
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:04,740
Well, once you're done here,

80
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:06,620
hurry up and change.

81
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:07,400
Come on.

82
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,200
Come on.

83
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:10,580
Jerry.

84
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:13,900
Uh-oh.

85
00:05:15,060 --> 00:05:18,800
I figured at the sea I could take their
swimsuit photos while they were off guard.

86
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,540
Quite naturally,

87
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:22,280
as easy as pie,

88
00:05:23,020 --> 00:05:24,840
without arousing any suspicion at all.

89
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:29,400
But I can't very well force them
into swimsuits out in the mountains.

90
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:33,820
And if I called the policewomen in one by
one and said I was going to take their photos,

91
00:05:33,820 --> 00:05:36,100
they'd definitely get suspicious.

92
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:39,660
I have to come up with something.

93
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:44,880
"Cooperate with me, I'm taking swimsuit photos of the policewomen,"
that's what I'd have to say.

94
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:45,560
That's it!

95
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:49,960
Nakagawa, right now I need your help.

96
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:52,140
No way, I'm not doing that.

97
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:54,500
Come on, please, Nakagawa. I'm begging you.

98
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,740
No way.

99
00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:58,640
Absolutely, positively not?

100
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,560
Absolutely, positively not.

101
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,840
Not even if I beg this much?

102
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:05,620
No matter how much you beg, it's a no.

103
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:06,720
Stingy!

104
00:06:07,100 --> 00:06:11,680
Why on earth would you need to
take lewd swimsuit photos anyway?

105
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,380
Well, that's the thing, sir.

106
00:06:13,380 --> 00:06:16,920
You're probably scheming some shady way to make money again,
aren't you?

107
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:21,240
Senpai, you really should
quit those kinds of side jobs.

108
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:23,360
No! Absolutely not!

109
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,560
Then what is it?

110
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,720
Well, that's the thing, sir.

111
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,100
See? You can't say it.

112
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:33,360
I can say it.
It's whether you'll believe me or not.

113
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:36,280
Just tell me, at least.

114
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,900
Well, the truth is...

115
00:06:41,220 --> 00:06:43,720
They say this is the cursed camera.

116
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,680
That's right.

117
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:49,760
If you take anything other than swimsuit photos with this camera,
misfortune will come to you.

118
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,540
What's with that face?

119
00:06:52,540 --> 00:06:56,580
Senior, if you're going to lie,
come up with a better one.

120
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,240
It's not a lie.

121
00:06:58,240 --> 00:07:00,560
Misfortune has already come to me.

122
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:03,680
Nobody's going to believe
such a made-up story.

123
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:07,380
Look into my eyes! Do these look
like the eyes of someone lying?

124
00:07:08,900 --> 00:07:10,620
It's really, truly true.

125
00:07:13,380 --> 00:07:16,840
If you're so doubtful,
why don't you try taking it yourself?

126
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:18,780
Me?

127
00:07:18,780 --> 00:07:22,940
Yeah, anything will do.
Go grab something lying around there.

128
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:25,400
Then how about this flower?

129
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:27,340
No, this teddy bear.

130
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:29,480
Or maybe this butterfly-chan?

131
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:33,040
Anything's fine,
just hurry up and shoot it, hurry!

132
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:36,400
But it'd be a waste of film, so...

133
00:07:36,860 --> 00:07:39,780
Maybe the angle's wrong after all.

134
00:07:40,660 --> 00:07:42,580
Maybe it's better from this side?

135
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,440
No, this side after all.

136
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:48,400
Maybe it's better from the front after all.

137
00:07:49,060 --> 00:07:52,340
Doesn't matter where,
just hurry up and take it, hurry.

138
00:07:52,340 --> 00:07:55,080
Yeah, the subject just isn't any good.

139
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,020
It's your fault.

140
00:07:56,020 --> 00:07:56,900
It's your fault.

141
00:07:56,900 --> 00:07:57,260
It's your fault.

142
00:07:57,260 --> 00:07:57,560
It's your fault.

143
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:57,760
It's your fault.

144
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:58,120
It's your fault.

145
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,680
It's your fault.

146
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,140
It's your fault.

147
00:07:59,780 --> 00:08:00,500
It's you, isn't it?

148
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:00,520
It's you, isn't it?

149
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,140
M-me?

150
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:03,080
Ready, senpai?

151
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,880
Say cheese.

152
00:08:05,180 --> 00:08:07,340
Shut up! Just hurry and move it!

153
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,560
But since we're here, senpai.

154
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,100
Cheese!

155
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,220
Yeah, cheese.

156
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:16,800
Senpai!

157
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:19,940
W-why come to me?

158
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:23,560
Huh? Huh?

159
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:26,120
Well? Did you get it, Nakagawa?

160
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,240
Y-yes, sort of.

161
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:30,760
So you're going to cooperate with me, then.

162
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:33,200
Yes, I'll cooperate.

163
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,580
But it's strange, isn't it.

164
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:42,340
Idiot, idiot! Don't point that at me!
No need to take any more, don't take any!

165
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:43,740
I understand.

166
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,640
This place is kind of nice, isn't it?

167
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,200
Choosing the mountains was
the right call after all!

168
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:03,920
Right!

169
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:07,880
I can see it now!

170
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:09,360
Where, where?

171
00:09:09,500 --> 00:09:10,800
Isn't it lovely?

172
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:12,220
Shut up!

173
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,560
Whoa!

174
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:27,580
This is the sea, isn't it?

175
00:09:27,580 --> 00:09:32,500
Why is there a sea in a place like this?

176
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:37,500
Nakagawa Leisure Development

177
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:40,880
Mr. Nakagawa, what is the meaning of this?

178
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:42,620
W-well, you see...

179
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:51,240
Welcome, everyone! Aloha!

180
00:09:51,730 --> 00:09:52,640
Ryo-chan

181
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:58,220
I'm overwhelmed!
The sea really is the best, after all!

182
00:09:58,750 --> 00:10:02,040
Oh sea, my sea!

183
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:06,940
The sea is so wide, so big!

184
00:10:07,980 --> 00:10:11,160
When it comes to summer,
it's the sea, no question about it.

185
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:16,040
Now, everyone, this beautiful
sea is your very own private beach!

186
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:18,640
Let's swim to our heart's content, shall we?

187
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,760
What is this, anyway?

188
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:23,380
Suddenly being told to
go swimming like that...

189
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:25,960
I didn't even bring a swimsuit.

190
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,720
No need to worry.

191
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:32,260
I've even got rental
swimsuits ready for you.

192
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:35,360
They're all the latest styles this year.

193
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:37,920
Come on, pick whichever one you like.

194
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:40,160
By the way, the rental fee is

195
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:41,400
free.

196
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:44,040
Wow, lucky!

197
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,180
Maybe I'll go with that one.

198
00:10:45,660 --> 00:10:46,800
This one's cool.

199
00:10:47,660 --> 00:10:49,660
Which is better, this one or this one?

200
00:10:53,580 --> 00:10:54,680
Wait a minute.

201
00:10:56,660 --> 00:10:58,200
Doesn't something seem off?

202
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:03,340
Please, nothing's off. Nothing at all.

203
00:11:03,340 --> 00:11:06,780
Ryotsu lending things for free?
That's way too suspicious.

204
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:10,100
Yeah, that's definitely strange
for a woman who loves money like him.

205
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:12,260
There's got to be a trap.

206
00:11:12,260 --> 00:11:15,620
Anyway, it's already weird that there's
a sea way out here in the mountains.

207
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:18,580
Come on, hurry up!

208
00:11:19,820 --> 00:11:20,880
Hurry!

209
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,960
I'm not falling for that one, you jerk!

210
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:26,520
You just shut up!

211
00:11:32,060 --> 00:11:35,120
Damn, these women are sharp.

212
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,840
Alright, then it's on to the next move.

213
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,000
Mm...

214
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:52,560
Ugh...

215
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:54,200
It's hot.

216
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:56,860
Honestly,

217
00:11:57,640 --> 00:11:59,560
It's hot for being in the mountains.

218
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:02,080
Experiencing nature is nice, but

219
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,580
following Guragura along

220
00:12:03,580 --> 00:12:04,580
we really wanted those, didn't we.

221
00:12:04,580 --> 00:12:05,860
Whoa!

222
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:08,940
It's already over 40 degrees, after all!

223
00:12:08,940 --> 00:12:10,020
Eeh?

224
00:12:22,740 --> 00:12:25,500
Senpai, there's no need to go this far.

225
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:29,660
Shut up! At this point,
I can't afford to be picky about methods.

226
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:35,560
It's no use. Maybe the sea
was the right choice after all.

227
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:36,880
Yahoo!

228
00:12:38,140 --> 00:12:39,260
Here we go, here we go, here we go!

229
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:41,220
Whoa! Oh no, we've done it!

230
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:50,440
The sea is great, isn't it.

231
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,740
When it's this hot, nothing beats the sea.

232
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:55,720
Honestly, I can only think about the sea.

233
00:12:59,340 --> 00:13:02,020
Everyone,
is this some kind of endurance contest?

234
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:03,560
Good luck, everyone!

235
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:05,260
In a temperature of 40 degrees.

236
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:06,840
Yay!

237
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:17,800
Delicious!

238
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:21,160
Watermelon really is the best when you eat it by the sea,
isn't it?

239
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:25,300
I can't understand anyone who
stays cooped up indoors in this heat.

240
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,660
I can't take it anymore.

241
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:29,140
I'm going to go for a swim.

242
00:13:29,140 --> 00:13:30,140
Me too.

243
00:13:30,140 --> 00:13:32,520
No way, it's obviously a trap.

244
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:37,100
Yes, welcome, welcome!

245
00:13:37,100 --> 00:13:39,660
Please,
do choose whichever swimsuit you like.

246
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:44,500
No, no, no!

247
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:46,220
Don't you dare come over here, you bastards!

248
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:47,300
No way,

249
00:13:47,940 --> 00:13:49,600
Why, senpai?

250
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:52,280
Shut up! This place is for women only!

251
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:53,680
You two, get lost!

252
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:56,320
Wow, he's really angry.

253
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,860
That's not normal, is it?

254
00:13:58,700 --> 00:14:00,020
I told you so.

255
00:14:00,020 --> 00:14:02,840
They'll probably make us
wear see-through swimsuits.

256
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:05,760
Getting closer is dangerous.

257
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:08,260
It's just like hell.

258
00:14:08,260 --> 00:14:10,980
Hey, everyone, this way!

259
00:14:10,980 --> 00:14:12,580
Hurry up and come on in.

260
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:20,200
Shit.

261
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:23,580
Given how I usually act,
nobody trusts me at all.

262
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:25,020
Ryo-sama.

263
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:27,980
I'll be wearing this, then.

264
00:14:28,640 --> 00:14:29,800
Until now, I had been

265
00:14:30,260 --> 00:14:33,420
acting with consideration
for harmony with you ladies,

266
00:14:33,420 --> 00:14:34,420
but after all,

267
00:14:34,420 --> 00:14:36,900
I can't betray Ryo-sama.

268
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:39,920
I'd be delighted to go into the sea.

269
00:14:41,100 --> 00:14:43,320
I see. I still have Maria.

270
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:46,920
Maria may be a man, but technically
she's still one of the ladies, after all.

271
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:56,260
Ryo-sama, do you think it suits me?

272
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,340
Wow, it's perfect!

273
00:14:58,340 --> 00:15:00,580
You look like a model, Maria.

274
00:15:00,580 --> 00:15:02,480
Well, but Ryo-sama...

275
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,880
Being stared at like that is embarrassing.

276
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:08,380
That's right, Maria!
Since we're here, I'll take your picture!

277
00:15:08,460 --> 00:15:10,120
Strike a pose!

278
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:10,940
Okay!

279
00:15:17,340 --> 00:15:19,400
Like this, Ryo-sama?

280
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:22,500
Okay, okay! Here I go!

281
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,380
Say cheese!

282
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:34,220
Ryo-sama!

283
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:37,420
You've seen right through all of it, though.

284
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:44,740
After all, let's go to the sea.
We're heading to the sea right now!

285
00:15:51,040 --> 00:15:56,500
What, are we going somewhere?
I heard the plan changed to the sea.

286
00:15:56,500 --> 00:15:57,600
What?

287
00:15:57,600 --> 00:16:02,100
Hey, look, you guys,
the sea's right in front of you!

288
00:16:02,700 --> 00:16:06,960
No way I'm swimming in a sea like that,
no thank you, Wei-sama.

289
00:16:07,580 --> 00:16:12,460
Well then.
Are you seriously ignoring us? Come on.

290
00:16:13,920 --> 00:16:18,500
Still, since we ended up going to the sea,
I guess that's fine.

291
00:16:20,020 --> 00:16:23,240
What did you say? What's wrong, Naoko?

292
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:24,940
Ryotsu, hey, Ryotsu!

293
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:28,080
We just got a message from the second car.

294
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:34,580
Just wait, I'll be taking some lewd,
risqué swimsuit photos of you soon.

295
00:16:35,940 --> 00:16:37,880
Ryo-chan would do something like that?

296
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:40,340
So that was his aim all along.

297
00:16:40,340 --> 00:16:42,180
He's probably planning
to sell us off somewhere.

298
00:16:42,180 --> 00:16:44,180
What should we do, Reiko-san?

299
00:17:04,640 --> 00:17:05,680
Yay!

300
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:06,860
The sea! It's the sea!

301
00:17:06,860 --> 00:17:08,540
Let's change quickly and go swimming.

302
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:09,780
Let's hurry and go!

303
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:14,520
Gentlemen,

304
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:16,720
your changing and accommodations are

305
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:18,040
over there.

306
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:22,620
Why?

307
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:28,480
Because there's someone among the men trying
to take secret swimsuit photos and sell them.

308
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,060
We'll keep the women completely separate.

309
00:17:31,620 --> 00:17:33,540
Why is everyone staring at me?

310
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:36,240
I have no intention of
doing anything like that.

311
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,100
Are you suspecting me?

312
00:17:40,500 --> 00:17:43,260
That's awful,
you're treating me like the culprit.

313
00:17:43,260 --> 00:17:46,100
I haven't done anything wrong.

314
00:17:46,900 --> 00:17:48,380
Sorry, Ryo-san.

315
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:51,160
Always jumping to the conclusion that it's
the senior officer whenever something happens.

316
00:17:52,620 --> 00:17:54,000
I have a message from all the officers.

317
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:56,200
Ryotsu, don't take photos!

318
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,260
That's all.

319
00:18:04,900 --> 00:18:08,040
Damn it, he even blindfolded us.

320
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:12,920
Here we go!

321
00:18:15,220 --> 00:18:16,060
Yay!

322
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:17,120
There!

323
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,760
This feels great.

324
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:21,840
The sea really is wonderful, isn't it?

325
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,740
It's just the best.

326
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:25,960
But as expected of Reiko-san.

327
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:28,140
I never thought he'd go
so far as to build a fence.

328
00:18:28,660 --> 00:18:30,080
But it's Ryo-chan we're dealing with.

329
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,980
We have to take this much precaution.

330
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:36,920
Must be nice, looking so much fun.

331
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:39,560
It's just like a bathhouse.

332
00:18:43,032 --> 00:18:44,272
Hey, everyone,

333
00:18:44,322 --> 00:18:47,640
since we're here,
shall we take a commemorative photo?

334
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:53,280
How did you figure it out?

335
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:55,200
Are you an idiot?

336
00:18:55,380 --> 00:18:57,440
That disguise is so obvious.

337
00:18:58,640 --> 00:18:59,080
Here!

338
00:19:00,420 --> 00:19:01,840
Now, attack!

339
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:08,960
Rumble rumble rumble rumble
rumble rumble rumble rumble! Dibs!

340
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:13,400
I'm telling you, they've figured us out!

341
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:17,220
Whoosh!

342
00:19:17,580 --> 00:19:19,460
Yaaah!

343
00:19:21,180 --> 00:19:23,100
If the bottom won't work, go from above!

344
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:25,120
Take this!

345
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:26,700
Whoa!

346
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:28,080
Whoa!

347
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:35,340
If it comes to this, it's our last resort!

348
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:46,820
A wave-generating machine, no less?

349
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:49,440
Isn't that going a bit too far?

350
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:51,200
No, it's fine.

351
00:19:51,200 --> 00:19:53,660
My whole life depends on this.

352
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:04,180
Sand?

353
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:05,420
What is this?

354
00:20:05,420 --> 00:20:07,040
The water's receding.

355
00:20:07,040 --> 00:20:10,220
That's strange,
the sea parting this quickly.

356
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:17,780
This time, I'm really going to get it right.

357
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:20,180
No, they're not here.

358
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:21,860
What?

359
00:20:30,660 --> 00:20:33,960
Sorry, but you'd better give up already.

360
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:41,720
This won't work, that won't work either.

361
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:46,500
Am I going to be unlucky
for the rest of my life?

362
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:54,680
Don't lose heart, senior.

363
00:20:55,340 --> 00:20:58,280
I'll introduce you to a good
onmyoji who can lift the curse.

364
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:01,840
No way. I'm not going to be unlucky for the rest of my life.
Don't joke.

365
00:21:03,140 --> 00:21:06,780
It's not as if the bad luck
will be deadly dangerous.

366
00:21:06,780 --> 00:21:08,440
I said no, and I mean no.

367
00:21:08,940 --> 00:21:10,580
Serves you right, Kankichi Ryotsu.

368
00:21:10,580 --> 00:21:13,240
Trying to sell photos of us in swimsuits!

369
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:16,200
You had a stupid idea,
and this is what you get.

370
00:21:16,660 --> 00:21:20,100
That's right.
I will never forgive you for this.

371
00:21:20,100 --> 00:21:23,760
I'm going to talk to Chief Tonda and have you fired,
you hear?

372
00:21:27,420 --> 00:21:29,520
Everyone, could you wait a moment?

373
00:21:30,500 --> 00:21:32,720
There's actually a reason for this.

374
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:36,620
I know it's hard to believe,

375
00:21:37,080 --> 00:21:40,120
but the camera Senpai
has is a cursed camera.

376
00:21:41,160 --> 00:21:44,880
So if he doesn't take lewd swimsuit photos,
misfortune will befall him.

377
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:47,660
Nakagawa-san.

378
00:21:47,660 --> 00:21:50,900
Even Nakagawa would tell such a lie,

379
00:21:50,900 --> 00:21:52,680
just to defend Kankichi Ryotsu.

380
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,480
Right?

381
00:21:54,060 --> 00:21:57,000
In the end, it's strange to expect
us to believe that, isn't it?

382
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:58,200
Senpai.

383
00:22:10,320 --> 00:22:12,080
Does that convince you?

384
00:22:12,800 --> 00:22:14,700
There's no trick to it, no gimmick at all.

385
00:22:16,500 --> 00:22:17,540
It seems that I'm cursed.

386
00:22:17,540 --> 00:22:23,060
So, I have a favor to ask.

387
00:22:23,620 --> 00:22:26,500
Could you let me take your swimsuit photos,
everyone?

388
00:22:32,080 --> 00:22:33,120
Fine.

389
00:22:33,120 --> 00:22:35,960
I'll let you take them this one time,
as a special exception.

390
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:39,080
Good for you, senpai.

391
00:22:40,500 --> 00:22:41,820
Say cheese!

392
00:22:48,080 --> 00:22:49,680
That makes 100 photos now.

393
00:22:54,900 --> 00:22:56,160
It's gone!

394
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:59,940
Yes! Now I'm free!

395
00:22:59,940 --> 00:23:02,140
It's a kyaho, it's a kyaho!

396
00:23:03,980 --> 00:23:05,940
That's great, senpai.

397
00:23:06,340 --> 00:23:10,160
If you'd just been honest from the start, we
wouldn't have had to go through all that trouble.

398
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:15,720
But given how you usually are, we'd never
have believed you even if you had been honest.

399
00:23:16,500 --> 00:23:17,040
It's disappeared!

400
00:23:17,280 --> 00:23:20,652
But to have taken a hundred
swimsuit photos of them,

401
00:23:20,702 --> 00:23:21,680
what a strange curse.

402
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:25,220
What on earth was that camera?

403
00:23:26,540 --> 00:23:28,300
Yay! Yay!

404
00:23:34,420 --> 00:23:38,340
Hoho, for a spirit photo,
these came out quite well.

405
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:43,435
No, no, this won't do.

406
00:23:43,485 --> 00:23:48,180
This is all part of the divine punishment I,
the Public Safety Chief, am delivering to Kankichi Ryotsu.

407
00:23:48,600 --> 00:23:50,287
Let this teach Ryotsu a lesson,

408
00:23:50,337 --> 00:23:52,892
so that he becomes a true
person people can trust,

409
00:23:52,942 --> 00:23:54,680
and he'll surely make some effort.

410
00:23:56,260 --> 00:23:56,880
But,

411
00:23:56,930 --> 00:24:00,280
I must say,
I've come up with a rather good punishment.

412
00:24:13,300 --> 00:24:17,100
Summer has come again this year.

413
00:24:18,940 --> 00:24:23,120
Summer has come again this year.

414
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:28,620
In the big water,
swim till you drop, ya-ju-kui.

415
00:24:28,620 --> 00:24:34,460
In the big water,
swim till you drop, ya-ju-kui.

416
00:24:34,460 --> 00:24:40,860
Summer has come again this year.

417
00:24:41,900 --> 00:24:43,540
Kita-tsu, kita-ba, kita fo!

418
00:24:44,540 --> 00:24:46,700
Summer has come again this year.

419
00:24:46,700 --> 00:24:48,920
Kita-tsu, kita fo!

420
00:24:48,920 --> 00:24:52,260
Big waves, little waves,
tiny little ones, that kind of thing.

421
00:24:52,260 --> 00:24:55,120
Yellowtail on the southern breeze.

422
00:24:55,120 --> 00:24:58,460
Big bottoms, little bottoms,
tiny little ones, that kind of thing.

423
00:24:58,460 --> 00:24:59,480
Aksara

424
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:02,720
Buri buri buri buri buri buri buri
buri buri buri buri buri buri buri buri

425
00:25:04,960 --> 00:25:08,320
Come on the southern breeze,

426
00:25:08,320 --> 00:25:14,240
come on the southern breeze,

427
00:25:16,800 --> 00:25:20,720
opening up on the shore!

428
00:25:21,980 --> 00:25:31,820
Yay! A hot spring!

429
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:38,580
We dug and dug, and lo and behold, a hot spring gushed out!
Right, now that it's come to this, let's make a fortune, and its name is, well,

430
00:25:38,580 --> 00:25:47,640
let's just build a huge hot spring leisure land from the eighth exit to the main line.
But the next hot spring at the departure point is fine, so, nice to meet you!

431
00:25:49,100 --> 00:25:49,460
me

432
00:25:52,200 --> 00:25:52,560
me

433
00:25:52,560 --> 00:25:54,020
surely to Kameari,

434
00:25:54,560 --> 00:25:57,260
everyone, come on over!

435
00:25:57,260 --> 00:25:59,240
to our town!

436
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:00,800
Thank you!

